# newdoc id = texts/birchbark/717
# date_created = 1160-1180
# transl_ru = Поклон от игуменьи к Офросении. Пришли привитку и повоев (или: повой). Если у тебя повоев много, то пришли их штук до пяти. А я сильно озабочена черницами: скоро постригать. Поэтому давай-ка разузнай, в монастыре ли Мафей (Матфей).
# transl_en_1 = Greetings from the Abbess to Ofrosen’ia. Send a privitka (a part of a garment) and veils (povoi) (or: veil). If you have many, then send up to 5 of them. And I am very concerned about the nuns: soon [a number] are to take their vows. Therefore, go ahead and find out if Mafei (Matfei) is in the monastery.
# transl_en_2 = A bow from the abbess to Ofrosenija. Send the habit and wimples. If (you have) a lot of wimples, send up to five wimples. I am extremely busy with the nuns; they have to be tonsured soon. Therefore, do find out if Mafej is at the monastery.
