# transl_en_1 = Or’sha’s wife owes 4½ rezanas. Borishko’s wife owes 2 nogatas. Korchka’s wife owes 2 nogatas. Giurgii’s wife owes 7 rezanas. Tekh’s wife, Nedel’ka, owes 2 nogatas. Bezzubaia (“Toothless”) [owes] 2 nogatas (or: Tekh’s wife owes 2 nogatas. Nedel’ka owes Bezzubaia (“Toothless”) 2 nogatas). | Iakim owes (?) Milka 4½ (of some units).
